# Precipitation cannot depend on bottle order
# Expectation: Reversing the equal silver/chloride additions should leave essentially equal AgCl solid amounts and pH in the two vessels.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaCl 0.001mol
add v1 AgNO3 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 AgNO3 0.001mol
add v2 NaCl 0.001mol
inspect
